  "next_check": "none",
  "memo": "R03 establishes the Card family through the issuing-country/IP mismatch and failed AVS. No Linkage condition holds, and household exceptions are unnecessary. No earlier outcome settles the order. The failed id_check decides immediately under FP-2 §5.3(b), overriding the ordinary verification path in §6.6(b): decline is standard, and escalation is prohibited without Linkage. Travel and a new device offer a benign explanation, but cannot override the failed check. The order is unshipped; decline would void and refund it and block the account. No further check is needed. This recommendation is advisory."
